1,-0.08827696,0.02706247,0.03323369,0.19398464,-0.06033558,-0.00513693,0.04649212,-0.00537662,-0.04201813,-0.00047118,0.00914697,0.00565232,0.00563745,0.07805539,-0.01056852,0.03809288,0.08264139,-0.00209534,-0.05212594,-0.00472922,-0.00969896,0.02150173,0.01969772,-0.01305951,-0.05092212,0.08461697,0.00649906,-0.02874797,-0.03178253,-0.00306766,0.01555221,-0.00795234,-0.0326147,-0.03522426,0.00362528,0.04448224,-0.00884464,0.03029917,-0.00013004,-0.02507241,-0.04332955,0.05400513,-0.02896066,-0.03518976,0.10059921,-0.08750393],"last_embed":{"hash":"5pwq2q","tokens":360}}},"last_read":{"hash":"5pwq2q","at":1774939654549},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939638420,"size":5007,"at":1774939651543,"hash":"5pwq2q"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview":[20,42],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#{1}":[21,25],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,28],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[29,31],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[32,34],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[33,34],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42],"#Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)#{1}":[42,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/93NP68AC","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/3PJQ4ZQ3?page=1&annotation=649DELBD","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 12","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/3PJQ4ZQ3?page=12&annotation=9JEUD4AQ","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 12","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/3PJQ4ZQ3?page=12&annotation=TS9K55ZH","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 13","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/3PJQ4ZQ3?page=13&annotation=PH5MYE5F","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 13","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/3PJQ4ZQ3?page=13&annotation=M6AQKP8U","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 13","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/3PJQ4ZQ3?page=13&annotation=Z5SHRMRK","line":42}],"metadata":{"Title":"Artificial intelligence applications in nutrition science: A brief thematic overview","Authors":"L. Biró","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.1556/066.2025.00210","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"This paper provides a thematic overview of the key research and practical applications, including image- and sensor-based tools for dietary intake assessment, predictive models used in food production and safety, public health and epidemiological applications, and precision nutrition strategies in clinical diagnostics and therapy. It also addresses the integration of diverse data sources and the recognition of complex biological patterns, while also highlighting ethical, legal, and data protection challenges.","Findings":"The application of artificial intelligence in the public health sector undeniably enhances diagnostic accuracy and improves the efficiency of healthcare delivery. At the same time, it raises serious ethical concerns – particularly regarding the protection of patient data, algorithmic bias, and legal accountabilityThe application of artificial intelligence in nutrition science and dietetics constitutes a major advancement in both research methodology and practical implementation. From measuring andmonitoring dietary intake to enhancing food chain safety and quality, supporting public health programs, and developing predictive models and personalised therapeutic strategies, advanced machine learning and analytical tools are playing an increasingly central ro","Conclusions":"Given the rapid evolution of AI technologies, some of the approaches or tools presented may become outdated or be replaced by newer, more effective methods. Finally, although the study touches on ethical, data protection, and regulatory issues, an in-depth analysis of these aspects was beyond its scope and merits further investigation","Limitations":"However, ethical, legal, and data protection concerns, together with the challenges of methodological validation, underscore the need to ground future developments in interdisciplinary collaboration and the establishment of professional standards.","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"5pwq2q","at":1774939654377}},"smart_blocks:biroArtificialIntelligenceApplications2025.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.03730412,0.01761703,0.00811712,-0.0204264,0.02356404,-0.00600316,0.01426264,0.05646849,0.02034322,0.00511681,-0.00876371,-0.11470822,0.01091816,0.01731584,0.05197873,-0.00991814,0.03627608,-0.01421343,0.00256088,0.02442886,0.06976753,-0.01026094,0.00398067,-0.03067831,0.00493686,0.01984482,-0.01507885,-0.02125893,-0.06270881,-0.22208674,0.02787161,-0.03626064,0.10425834,-0.04899286,-0.04114724,0.01313673,0.00115969,0.04882893,-0.01880735,0.01429666,0.0197289,-0.00405518,0.03856891,-0.00604065,-0.02144329,0.00673442,-0.04941152,-0.0139981,-0.09745788,-0.025136